{"2769310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Lost Tape - Cellar", "steam_appid": 2769310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Story</strong><br><br>The main character you will play is named Eric. <br>Eric wakes up in an unknown cellar on a mattress right next to a large black stain on the wall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769310/extras/ab43a9f54c05371a6db38e796a4a075e.avif?t=1779914557\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br> In the cellar, he finds only an old VHS camera that constantly shows the time as 3:44:59/60 and an empty journal. After a while, the black stain speaks to Eric and offers him a key that would get him out of the cellar. However, in exchange, the stain wants Eric to enter a cave and find a hand.<br><br><strong>Journal</strong><br><br>Eric will record his thoughts, feelings, and also tasks he plans to do in the journal. The journal is narrated, and if you wish, Eric will read each entry for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769310/extras/136396028dc9caa1cd248f2647753a95.avif?t=1779914557\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br><strong>Key features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Finding objects <br></li><li> Solving puzzles<br></li><li> Experiencing the story with the main character <br></li><li> Finding secrets </li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Story</strong><br><br>The main character you will play is named Eric. <br>Eric wakes up in an unknown cellar on a mattress right next to a large black stain on the wall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769310/extras/ab43a9f54c05371a6db38e796a4a075e.avif?t=1779914557\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br> In the cellar, he finds only an old VHS camera that constantly shows the time as 3:44:59/60 and an empty journal. After a while, the black stain speaks to Eric and offers him a key that would get him out of the cellar. However, in exchange, the stain wants Eric to enter a cave and find a hand.<br><br><strong>Journal</strong><br><br>Eric will record his thoughts, feelings, and also tasks he plans to do in the journal. The journal is narrated, and if you wish, Eric will read each entry for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769310/extras/136396028dc9caa1cd248f2647753a95.avif?t=1779914557\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br><strong>Key features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Finding objects <br></li><li> Solving puzzles<br></li><li> Experiencing the story with the main character <br></li><li> Finding secrets </li></ul>", "short_description": "A psychological horror game in which you wake up in an unknown cellar with a VHS camera and a journal. In the narrated journal, the main character will be recording their thoughts. Your task will be to get out of the cellar.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769310/header.jpg?t=1779914557", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779914557", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779914557", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 260 2 GB<br></li><